# Secrets
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# E2E emulator-only env file is committed: it only contains a non-secret
# BYPASS_APP_CHECK flag used to allow Cloud Functions to accept emulator
# calls. Production deploys NEVER set this.
!functions/.env.supporters-bus-e2e

